Task: isolated characters
Definition: characters who are canonically significant in this scope AND belong to no group of any kind - no friend circle, no organization, no faction, no nation with narrative weight.
Both conditions are required. A character who is significant but holds any group membership is not an isolate. A character with no memberships who is also insignificant is not an isolate.
Return names in the isolates field. Leave groups empty.